                                "sense_id": "851a5481-a7df-3c5e-8cee-41680a1afe84",
                                "text": "I feel for a moment that I understand the whole bright dailiness of our life before this: the morning glances at the bathroom sink, the spit of toothpaste, the cramp and comfort of our hall and living room and kitchen – understand it and also understand that it is gone."
